calized_name":"A World Reborn","name":"A World Reborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/599610/fdf134a51e5b650ea4c59489be6338aaa1c1ba28.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/599610?t=1770316953","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770316953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770316953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770316953","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Buzz</h1><p>Independent Games Festival Finalist</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/54b4bd9051dec94e2aa052e75cb86634.poster.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/54b4bd9051dec94e2aa052e75cb86634.webm?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/54b4bd9051dec94e2aa052e75cb86634.mp4?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Words is an atmospheric narrative adventure that takes place in the personal diary entries belonging to a young girl named Izzy that will unfold as you explore a fantasy land where words hold immense power. Featuring an immersive story crafted by renowned games writer Rhianna Pratchett, <strong>Lost Words: Beyond the Page</strong> will mesmerize players with its unique blend of gameplay mechanics and striking watercolour aesthetic. Driven by the player\u2019s curiosity, the world of Estoria and the power it holds will serve as the engine that will propel Izzy through this deeply personal narrative, resulting in a truly memorable experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/1194520fdeee741d0cb8b81468c9dcdc.poster.avif?t=1770316953\" width=614 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/1194520fdeee741d0cb8b81468c9dcdc.webm?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/1194520fdeee741d0cb8b81468c9dcdc.mp4?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate 2D worlds set inside a young girl\u2019s diary by walking on the words and using them to solve a variety of puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/16e1f1c1782b90dde13df2914bc0e839.poster.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/16e1f1c1782b90dde13df2914bc0e839.webm?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an emotionally moving, fully-voiced narrative developed by renowned games writer Rhianna Pratchett as you make decisions that will alter how the story will unfold, making each playthrough unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/09b267f53d1bfc04db5d07e26f7d11a9.poster.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/09b267f53d1bfc04db5d07e26f7d11a9.webm?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beautiful Visual Style. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the watercolour world presented in the pages of the diary as well as the vibrant fantasy world of Estoria. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/616eea9489a26a787aa9e7b806ef637c.poster.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/616eea9489a26a787aa9e7b806ef637c.webm?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Gameplay.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness words to alter the environment around you to create a safe passage for the protagonist in an entirely unique and refreshing style of platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful Exploration. Gather collectible fireflies scattered across the lands of Estoria for an additional challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/1dda3534c75861b83be460f81182389e.poster.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/1dda3534c75861b83be460f81182389e.webm?t=1770316953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/15bbc4ba62634305ad913116b5b0095a.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/extras/3749f8a1dcb1e05f6f4b37a1de7bb580.avif?t=1770316953\" width=616 height=208 /></span></p>","developers":["Sketchbook Developments","Fourth State","Sketchbook Games"],"dlc":[1327700],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/599610/header.jpg?t=1770316953","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Sketchbook Games. All rights reserved. Published by Sketchbook Games. All trademarks or registered trademarks belong to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/599610/365733/2b6efdde2f3b799200bfb356a39bab6826e711bc/1750559917/dash_av1.mpd?t=1619630601","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/599610/365733/2b6efdde2f3b799200bfb356a39bab6826e711bc/1750559917/dash_h264.mpd?t=1619630601","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamst